{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-56-1","title":"Psalms 56:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David, praying to God in confidence of his word, complains of his enemies. 9 He professes his confidence in God's word, and promises to praise him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2942. B.C. 1062. (Title.) upon {Jonath-elem-rechokim.} Or, as it may be rendered, \"concerning the dumb dove, (or oppressed band) in distant places,\" i.e., David, or his companions; though some consider it as the name of a tune, and others a musical instrument.</p>\n<p>Michtam. or, a golden Psalm. 16:1; 57:1; 58:1; 59:1; 60:1; *titles when. 1Sa 21:11-15; 29:4 Be. 31:9; 57:1-3; 59:10; 69:13-16; 136:10,15,17-20; 143:12 swallow. 21:9; 27:2; 35:25; 57:3; 106:17; 124:3; Pr 1:12; La 2:2,5,16; Ho 8:8 1Co 15:54</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-2","title":"Psalms 56:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>enemies. Heb. observers. 54:5 many. 3:1; 118:10-12; Ac 4:25-27; Re 16:14 most. 9:2; 91:1; 92:1,8; 93:4; Isa 57:15; Da 5:18; Mic 6:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-3","title":"Psalms 56:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>34:4; 55:4,5; 1Sa 21:10,12; 30:6; 2Ch 20:3; 2Co 1:8-10; 7:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-4","title":"Psalms 56:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>In God I will. 10,11; 12:6; 19:7,8; 119:89,90,160; 138:2; Joh 10:35 in God I have. 27:1; 46:1,2; 118:6; Isa 31:3; 41:10; Lu 12:4,5; Ro 8:31-39 Heb 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-5","title":"Psalms 56:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>they. Isa 29:20,21; Mt 22:15; 26:61; Lu 11:54; Joh 2:19; 2Pe 3:16 all. 1Sa 18:17,21,29; 20:7,33; Jer 18:18; Lu 22:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-6","title":"Psalms 56:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>gather. 2:1-3; 59:3; 71:10; 140:2; Mt 26:3,4,57; 27:1; Ac 4:5,6; 23:12-14 hide. 10:8-10; 64:2-6; Da 6:4 mark. 37:32; 57:6; 89:51; Job 14:16; 31:4; Jer 20:10; Lu 20:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-7","title":"Psalms 56:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>escape. 94:20,21; Ec 8:8; Isa 28:15; Jer 7:10; Hab 1:13 in thine. 55:9,15,23; Jer 10:25; 18:19-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-8","title":"Psalms 56:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>tellest. 105:13,14; 121:8; Nu 33:2-56; 1Sa 19:18; 22:1-5; 27:1; Isa 63:9 2Co 11:26; Heb 11:8,13,38 put. 39:12; 126:5,6; 2Ki 20:5; Job 16:20; Re 7:17 are they. 139:16; Mal 3:16; Mt 10:30; Re 20:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-9","title":"Psalms 56:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>When. 118:11-13; Ex 17:9-11; Jer 33:3 then. 18:38-42; 27:2; Joh 18:6 for. 46:7,11; Isa 8:9,10; Ro 8:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-10","title":"Psalms 56:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>4; 60:6; Ge 32:11; Mt 24:35; Heb 6:18; 2Pe 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-11","title":"Psalms 56:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I will not. 27:1; 112:7,8; Isa 51:7,8,12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-12","title":"Psalms 56:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Thy. 66:13,14; 76:11; 116:14-19; 119:106; Ge 28:20-22; 35:1-3 Nu 30:2-16; 1Sa 1:11,24-28; Ec 5:4-6 I will. 9:1-3; 21:13; 59:16,17; Isa 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-56-13","title":"Psalms 56:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":56,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":56,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>For. 86:12,13; 116:8; 2Co 1:10; 1Th 1:10; Heb 2:15; Jas 5:20 wilt. 17:5; 94:18; 145:14; 1Sa 2:9 walk. 116:9; Ge 17:1; Isa 2:5; 38:3 the light. Job 33:30; Joh 8:12; 12:35,36; Eph 5:8-14; Re 21:23,24</p>"}]}